# Elegy Acolyte: "Whenever ONE OR MORE creatures you control deal combat damage to a player" (CR 603.2c): the Acolyte (4)
# and a Llanowar Elves (1) both unblocked on Bot2 are one batch of damage to one player, so one trigger: one card, one
# life lost - not two. Bot2: 20 - 5 = 15; Bot1: 20 + 4 lifelink (only the Acolyte has it) - 1 = 23. Hand: an Island
# left from turn 1, the turn-3 draw, and the one trigger's card = 3.

